            "title": "Who you are dealing with",
            "body": "<p>This store is operated by RYVT LLC, a Michigan limited liability company with its workshop in Metro Detroit. Where these terms say \u201cwe\u201d or \u201cus\u201d, they mean RYVT LLC. Where they say \u201cyou\u201d, they mean the person placing the order.</p> <p>Placing an order means you accept these terms as they read on the day you order. We may change them, but a change never applies backwards to an order already placed.</p>",
