            "title": "Limitation of liability",
            "body": "<p>Our total liability for any order is limited to the amount you paid for it. We are not liable for indirect or consequential loss, including lost profit or lost opportunity. This limit does not apply to the matters listed in section 05 that cannot lawfully be limited.</p>",
